From 793ccc847bf57822154b08221a2bf89cef3312c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SwitchVN contributors <switchvn@local>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 10:57:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] qasf: Expose the DirectShow color space converter

Register CLSID_Colour as a qasf DMO wrapper around the private winedmo color converter, and implement the converter IMediaObject adapter required by DirectShow.
---
 dlls/qasf/dmowrapper.c       |  37 ++++-
 dlls/qasf/qasf_classes.idl   |   7 +
 dlls/qasf/qasf_main.c        |   3 +
 dlls/qasf/qasf_private.h     |   1 +
 dlls/qasf/tests/dmowrapper.c | 166 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/winedmo/color_convert.c | 264 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 6 files changed, 437 insertions(+), 41 deletions(-)

